</ul>
<ul>
<li>[[Bruce Metzger]] (1914–2007): ahli [[Alkitab]] yang dijuluki "the dean of New Testament textual criticism" ("dekan kritik teks Perjanjian Baru") dan menulis buku definitif, The Text of the New Testament ("Teks Perjanjian Baru", [[Oxford University Press]], 1964)</li>
</ul>
